        {
          "text": "State Of Gujarat",
          "label": "RESPONDENT",
          "start": 295,
          "end": 311
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "Heard the learned Senior Counsel appearing for the appellant and the learned counsel appearing for the respondent-State.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 356,
      "end": 476,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "Despite notice being served, the de-facto complainant-informant has chosen not to appear before this Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 477,
      "end": 585,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19186866283416748
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "The appellant got married with the son of de-facto complainant-respondent no.2 on 05.07.2014.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 586,
      "end": 680,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "05.07.2014",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 669,
          "end": 679
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4628295600414276
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Immediately thereafter, an application was made by respondent no.2 seeking issuance of passport on behalf of the appellant, as his son was gainfully employed in the United Kingdom.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 681,
      "end": 862,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "United Kingdom",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 847,
          "end": 861
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3750167489051819
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "This was done to facilitate the appellant to join her husband abroad.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 863,
      "end": 932,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.37599679827690125
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The appellant was issued with a passport during her stay at her matrimonial home on 21.08.2014.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 933,
      "end": 1029,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "21.08.2014",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1018,
          "end": 1028
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.48664864897727966
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "An application was filed, jointly with her husband, by the appellant on 17.03.2020 seeking issuance Poonam Bhupatbhai Odedra vs State Of Gujarat on 15 September, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/61417792/\n1 of residency permit of the United Kingdom.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1030,
      "end": 1296,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "17.03.2020",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1103,
          "end": 1113
        },
        {
          "text": "Poonam Bhupatbhai Odedra vs State Of Gujarat on 15 September, 2023 Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1131,
          "end": 1211
        },
        {
          "text": "United Kingdom",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1281,
          "end": 1295
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5181248784065247
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The relationship between the appellants family and her husbands family turned sour leading to a complaint being filed on behalf of the appellant by her mother in the month of August, 2020.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1297,
      "end": 1485,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.35071879625320435
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "A case was registered on 25.08.2020 in F.I.R.\nNo.11218001200011 for the offences punishable under Section(s) 498A, 323, 406, 420, 506(2),\n120B, 109, 494 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860 and Section(s) 3 and 5 of the Dowry Prohibition Act,\n1961.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1486,
      "end": 1728,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "25.08.2020",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1511,
          "end": 1521
        },
        {
          "text": "F.I.R.\nNo.11218001200011",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1525,
          "end": 1549
        },
        {
          "text": "Section(s) 498A",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1584,
          "end": 1599
        },
        {
          "text": "323",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1601,
          "end": 1604
        },
        {
          "text": "406",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1606,
          "end": 1609
        },
        {
          "text": "420",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1611,
          "end": 1614
        },
        {
          "text": "506(2)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1616,
          "end": 1622
        },
        {
          "text": "120B",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1623,
          "end": 1628
        },
        {
          "text": "109",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1630,
          "end": 1633
        },
        {
          "text": "494",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1635,
          "end": 1638
        },
        {
          "text": "Indian Penal Code, 1860",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1646,
          "end": 1669
        },
        {
          "text": "Section(s) 3",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1674,
          "end": 1686
        },
        {
          "text": "5",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1691,
          "end": 1692
        },
        {
          "text": "Dowry Prohibition Act,\n1961",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1700,
          "end": 1727
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.47982293367385864
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "It appears, that as a counter blast the present complaint has been filed by respondent no. 2, inter alia alleging that the appellant has forged the documents at the time of obtaining her passport in the year 2014.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1729,
      "end": 1943,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30031734704971313
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Both the appellant and her husband initiated divorce proceedings against each other which are stated to be pending in the United Kingdom.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1944,
      "end": 2082,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "United Kingdom",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2067,
          "end": 2081
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.46604123711586
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "As the appellant was residing in the United Kingdom,\nshe was not able to appear in pursuant to the case registered against her for forging documents,\nwhich led to the issuance of a look- out circular against her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2083,
      "end": 2295,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "United Kingdom",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2120,
          "end": 2134
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.41237950325012207
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "Seeking to quash the registration of FIR No.11191036220094 of 2022, the appellant approached the High Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2296,
      "end": 2404,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.39840519428253174
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The said petition was rejected in the impugned order on the grounds that the facts cannot be adjudicated upon.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2405,
      "end": 2515,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4050915241241455
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Challenging the same, the present appeal has been preferred before this Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2516,
      "end": 2595,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27295804023742676
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "We find force in the submission made by the learned Senior Counsel appearing for the appellant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2596,
      "end": 2692,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08129377663135529
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "The registration of the FIR, at the instance of respondent no.2, is certainly an abuse of the process of law, warranting interference by invoking Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2693,
      "end": 2892,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 482",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2840,
          "end": 2851
        },
        {
          "text": "Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2859,
          "end": 2891
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.7319333553314209
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "It is to be noticed that the complaint was given by respondent no.2 as a counter blast to the case registered against his son.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2893,
      "end": 3020,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4931625425815582
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "The application was made by the appellant after her marriage seeking a passport during her stay at the matrimonial home.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3021,
      "end": 3141,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6094933152198792
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "There is a reason why the complaint was given as certain facts are allegedly known to respondent no.2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3142,
      "end": 3245,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.44941723346710205
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "The alleged occurrence was in the year 2014 whereas the complaint was given in the year 2021.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3246,
      "end": 3339,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5271903872489929
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "Taking into consideration the aforesaid facts, we are inclined to set aside the impugned order of the High Court and consequently the FIR under challenge is quashed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3340,
      "end": 3506,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21591435372829437
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "The appeal is allowed accordingly.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3507,
      "end": 3542,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22999243438243866
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "Consequently, the look-out circular issued against the appellant also stands set aside.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3543,
      "end": 3630,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18380843102931976
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "Pending application(s), if any, stand(s) disposed of.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3631,
      "end": 3684,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17221800982952118
    },
